% Citations for the Polaris benchmark suite as used in this paper.
%
% Our "Ames" panel is one benchmark (tdcommons/ames) inside a 28-benchmark Polaris suite.
% Polaris is a PLATFORM, not a dataset -- it hosts benchmarks whose data comes from elsewhere --
% so citing it alone would credit the hosting and not the data. The 28 benchmarks we score break
% down as:
%
%   17  tdcommons/*            -> Therapeutics Data Commons  (huang2021tdc / huang2022tdc)
%    6  polaris/adme-fang-*    -> Fang et al. 2023           (fang2023adme)
%    5  polaris/pkis2-*        -> PKIS2, Drewry et al. 2017  (drewry2017pkis2)
%
% Minimum honest citation for a sentence naming Ames: wognum2024polaris + huang2021tdc.
% Every field below was verified against Crossref metadata (2026-08-20), not reconstructed
% from memory -- except zenodo_polaris, see the note on that entry.

% ---- the platform, and its evaluation protocol ------------------------------------------------
